1,Soukous - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Soukous,"Across Africa, soukous became one of the most dominant dance music styles and strongly influenced the development of many forms of modern African popular music, including benga music, muziki wa dansi, Kidandali, Igbo highlife, palm-wine music, and taarab.",Kwangali,Niger-Congo
2,Music of the Republic of the Congo - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music_of_the_Republic_of_the_Congo,"May 13, 2025 - The Republic of the Congo is an African nation with close musical ties to its neighbor, the Democratic Republic of the Congo. The Democratic Republic of the Congo's homegrown pop music, soukous, is popular across the border, and musicians from both countries have fluidly travelled throughout ...",Kwangali,Niger-Congo
